message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "HistorianRCA: A Root Cause Analysis Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  90 days of simulated plant historian data from a steam-heated agitated
  hold tank, containing abnormal events with known root causes, for testing
  root cause analysis by engineers, statistical methods, machine learning or
  AI agents.
